# NODX 1.0 Extended Showcase {#showcase-title}

This document exercises the NODX 1.0 reference contract: declarative TOCs,
explicit `profiles`, safe NODS styling, custom components with fallbacks, safe
asset references, and agent-readable IDs and hashes.

