Local SVG asset rendered by safe viewers or shown through fallback text.
:::
:::

:::media {#demo-video src="assets/demo-placeholder.txt" alt="Demo transcript placeholder"}
Media playback is disabled by default. This fallback explains what a video or
audio renderer would expose in a safe host.
:::

:::embed {#external-report src="reports/compliance.pdf" alt="Compliance report"}
This embed points at a package-local report. Renderers that cannot display PDF
should keep this fallback.
:::
::::

::::section {#agent}
## Agent surface

Agents see resolved IDs and shared `sha256-…` hashes in the NCP semantic
projection (`nodx ncp doc.nodx`). Mutations go through the Agent SDK, which
requires `beforeHash`, validates after every operation, and rolls back failed
batches atomically.

:::code {#sample-change-record lang="jsonl"}
{"schema":"nodx/change/1.0","op":"set-attribute","target":"#approval","beforeHash":"sha256-…","afterHash":"sha256-…","author":"agent:reviewer","time":"2026-05-10T10:00:00Z","reason":"Mark approval state","path":"3.2"}
:::
::::

